            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-08-10T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-11T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-09T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-10T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers, most likely in the early morning. Winds west to northwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending west to southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h before dawn then becoming light in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 7 with daytime temperatures reaching around 18.</text>
